      {
        "id": "AC4",
        "text": "AC4: the Postcards preview in a headed 390x844 Admin browser shows the rendered SVG after a POST 200, with no console or page errors."
      },
      {
        "id": "AC5",
        "text": "AC5: the OpenAPI entry for the route matches the implemented request and response contract."
      }
    ],
    "expected_behavior": "The route exists behind admin.growth.read with trusted-origin CSRF, validates headline/sub/kind/config strictly, renders a non-persisting SVG postcard with XML-escaped text and hex-validated colors, returns base64Svg, and the UI displays it.",
